  "description": "A smiling Black woman wearing a black headscarf and a grey scarf, holding a small American flag. She appears to be outdoors in front of a building with columns, possibly the White House. Her expression is cheerful and she is gesturing with her hands. The visual material is central to the meme's intent, as her identity as a Black woman is juxtaposed with the exclusionary text to create a false equivalence and imply racial hierarchy.",
